<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-KLZ first half net A$9.2 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-KLZ first half net A$9.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   12.02  vs   6.52</p>
<p>    Net				     9.21  vs   4.25</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	  8.0   vs   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE: KLZ Ltd is a building materials and office supplies manufacturer and supplier. It released unaudited first half results on February 18. These audited results confirm those results issued on February 18.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  98.41  vs  41.76</p>
<p>    Other income			  1.22  vs   2.73</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  17.1   vs   7.9</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	  profit    2.26  vs   0.24   loss</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 21</p>
<p>Reg date April 3</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.59  vs   2.80</p>
<p>    Interest				1.98  vs   0.75</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  1.46  vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Minorities		   loss   0.13  vs   0.53</p>
</text>
